### CRM System API
# VS Code REST Client yoki JetBrains HTTP Client orqali ishga tushirish mumkin.
# Login javobidagi HttpOnly cookie'lar keyingi so'rovlarda avtomatik yuboriladi.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@login = superadmin
@password = change-me
@companyId = COMPANY_ID
@roleId = ROLE_ID
@userId = USER_ID
@newAdminId = NEW_ADMIN_USER_ID

### Tizim holatini tekshirish (ochiq endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/


### AUTH

### Tizimga kirish va auth cookie'larini olish
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "{{login}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Joriy foydalanuvchi profilini olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile

### Access va refresh tokenlarni yangilash
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### Tizimdan chiqish va auth cookie'larini tozalash
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout


### COMPANIES
# Quyidagi endpointlar login va tegishli companies.* permissionini talab qiladi.

### Barcha kompaniyalarni olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies

### Bitta kompaniyani ID orqali olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}

### Yangi kompaniya yaratish
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Demo Company",
  "type": "retail",
  "brandColor": "#2563EB",
  "isActive": true
}

### Kompaniya ma'lumotlarini qisman yangilash
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Updated Company",
  "brandColor": "#16A34A"
}

### Kompaniyani arxivlash (faqat Super Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/archive

### Kompaniyani arxivdan tiklash (faqat Super Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/restore

### Kompaniyani butunlay o'chirish (faqat Super Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}

### Kompaniya uchun yangi admin yaratish (faqat Super Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali",
  "middleName": "Valiyev",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "login": "company.admin",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Kompaniyaning amaldagi adminini almashtirish (faqat Super Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/admin/replace
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newAdminId": "{{newAdminId}}"
}


### GLOBAL ROLES
# Rollar barcha kompaniyalar uchun umumiy. Yaratish va yangilash faqat Super Admin uchun.

### Yangi global company rol yaratish (faqat Super Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleName": "Manager",
  "slug": "manager",
  "permissions": [
    "users.read",
    "customers.read",
    "customers.create"
  ],
  "isActive": true
}

### Barcha global company rollarini olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles

### Bitta global company rolini olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles/{{roleId}}

### Global company rolini qisman yangilash (faqat Super Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roles/{{roleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleName": "Senior Manager",
  "permissions": [
    "users.read",
    "users.create",
    "customers.read",
    "customers.create",
    "customers.update"
  ]
}


### SYSTEM ROLES
# Faqat Super Admin uchun; roles.read permissioni talab qilinadi.

### Barcha global rollarni, jumladan system rollarni olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/roles


### COMPANY USERS
# Joriy foydalanuvchining kompaniyasi doirasida ishlaydi va users.* permissionini talab qiladi.

### Joriy kompaniyaning barcha foydalanuvchilarini olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Joriy kompaniyadagi bitta foydalanuvchini olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Joriy kompaniyada yangi foydalanuvchi yaratish
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vali",
  "middleName": "Aliyev",
  "roleId": "{{roleId}}",
  "password": "secret123",
  "login": "vali.aliyev",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "status": "active"
}

### Joriy kompaniyadagi foydalanuvchini qisman yangilash
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Valijon",
  "roleId": "{{roleId}}",
  "status": "inactive"
}

### Joriy kompaniyadagi foydalanuvchini o'chirish
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}


### SYSTEM USERS
# Faqat Super Admin uchun; tegishli users.* permissioni talab qilinadi.

### Tanlangan kompaniyaning foydalanuvchilarini olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/users

### Barcha kompaniyalardagi foydalanuvchilarni olish
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/users

### Tanlangan kompaniyada yangi foydalanuvchi yaratish
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hasan",
  "middleName": "Karimov",
  "roleId": "{{roleId}}",
  "password": "secret123",
  "login": "hasan.karimov",
  "phone": "+998909876543",
  "status": "active"
}

